Objective
Establish a clear, shared understanding of your project’s current technical state and readiness for Senior Project II.

Tasks
Review your Lovable.dev–generated codebase

Document current system architecture (components, data flow, dependencies)

Identify technical debt, risks, and unknowns

Audit GitHub Project Board for backlog quality and completeness

Deliverables
Project Reset Report (PDF or Markdown) including:

Architecture diagram

Risk & technical debt list

Backlog health assessment

Initial Senior Project II priorities

Submission Type
File Upload - PDF

Rubric (10 pts)
Architecture Diagram Quality (2 pts)
Clear components, readable labels, meaningful relationships

Architecture Explanation (2 pts)
Accurate summary of how the system works end-to-end

Technical Debt & Risk Identification (2 pts)
Realistic risks + severity + impact

Backlog Health & Readiness (2 pts)
Evidence of review + improvement recommendations

Professional Quality & Completeness (2 pts)
Organized, polished, complete, easy to follow